{"title": "Charger", "pageid": 8381, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Charger", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Charger_Weapon_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Charger_Weapon_Attack.webp/300px-Charger_Weapon_Attack.webp, /w/images/1/12/Charger_Weapon_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Charger_Weapon_Attack.webp/300px-Charger_Weapon_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Charger_Weapon_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Charger</b> is a passive feature granted to those who take a <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. It lets the user charge forward and either push or shove a target.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Let your speed intensify your onslaught. You can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charger:_Shove\" title=\"Charger: Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shove\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charger:_Shove\" title=\"Charger: Shove\">Shove</a> or deal additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charger:_Weapon_Attack\" title=\"Charger: Weapon Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Weapon Damage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charger:_Weapon_Attack\" title=\"Charger: Weapon Attack\">Weapon Damage</a> when you attack. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charger:_Shove\" title=\"Charger: Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/60px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/80px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charger: Shove\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charger:_Shove\" title=\"Charger: Shove\">Charger: Shove</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charger:_Weapon_Attack\" title=\"Charger: Weapon Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/60px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/80px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charger: Weapon Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charger:_Weapon_Attack\" title=\"Charger: Weapon Attack\">Charger: Weapon Attack</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Charger_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Charger (Feat)\">Charger (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Brammels\" title=\"Brammels\">Brammels</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg\" title=\"Dugg\">Dugg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Edvidge\" title=\"Edvidge\">Edvidge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Faril\" title=\"Faril\">Faril</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Forstum\" title=\"Forstum\">Forstum</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Humgoole\" title=\"Humgoole\">Humgoole</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Karol\" title=\"Karol\">Karol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mofty\" title=\"Mofty\">Mofty</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nickelow\" title=\"Nickelow\">Nickelow</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Taslim\" title=\"Taslim\">Taslim</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vikki\" title=\"Vikki\">Vikki</a></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203351\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1327/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8964/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2951/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 637/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 901027/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.418      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   37.418      1 -total\n 44.22%   16.545      4 Template:SAI\n 41.54%   15.543      4 Template:Icon_link\n 40.10%   15.003      4 Template:Icon_text\n 34.45%   12.889      8 Template:Trim\n 25.69%    9.614      4 Template:Ifempty\n 11.28%    4.222      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.48%    3.923      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.27%    3.470      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:8381-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203351 and revision id 197698. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}